WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.506
Hey, welcome to Connect. This takes about a minute and a half, so let me show you around.

2
00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:14.527
Start right here. Tap what you need, taxes, HVAC work, home care, or a job, and Connect sends you to the right place.

3
00:00:15.527 --> 00:00:24.039
For the member side, tap Join. Put in your name, your phone, and your email. We'll email you a six-digit code. No password to remember.

4
00:00:25.039 --> 00:00:31.482
This is your home screen. Your years in the trade count up from the day you started school. That day is year one.

5
00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:43.597
Under Jobs, you'll find openings we've found and checked, with the pay, what they're looking for, and what papers you'll need. Got an ITIN? Tap Work papers, and it'll tell you straight.

6
00:00:44.597 --> 00:00:53.322
Save a job, and it lands in your tracker. Mark when you applied, log your calls, set a follow-up, and attach your resume. Only you can see it.

7
00:00:54.322 --> 00:01:02.578
Learn is for quick study. Flip flashcards, take a picture quiz, or tap Listen in the car, and it reads everything to you, hands free.

8
00:01:03.578 --> 00:01:09.061
Wisdom is one good idea at a time. Swipe up for the next one. Tap the heart to keep it.

9
00:01:10.061 --> 00:01:15.394
Keep photos of your licenses, front and back, and we'll remind you before they expire.

10
00:01:16.394 --> 00:01:26.037
And here's the best part. No signal? No problem. Connect still works. Everything you change saves on your phone, and it syncs the moment you're back online.

11
00:01:27.037 --> 00:01:36.146
Stuck? Tap the Help bubble at the bottom. You can watch this again, ask a question, or text a real person on our team. Alright, go get it.

